1
00:00:00,073 --> 00:00:01,453
(Leonard:)Here. Breathe this in.

2
00:00:01,658 --> 00:00:05,288
But before I do it, if you're a cop,
you have to tell me, right?

3
00:00:06,329 --> 00:00:09,249
- Just try it.
- Okay.

4
00:00:10,834 --> 00:00:14,214
what's it supposed to?...
Oh, my God, that is so freaky.

5
00:00:18,425 --> 00:00:21,135
(Leonard(in low voice):)You're a mean one, Mr. Grinch.

6
00:00:22,595 --> 00:00:24,095
Again. Me, me. Okay.

7
00:00:26,433 --> 00:00:28,063
(Penny:)Leonard, I am your father.

8
00:00:30,937 --> 00:00:33,437
l have never
been more attracted to a woman...

9
00:00:33,648 --> 00:00:36,278
(Leonard:)- ...who sounds like a man in my life.
- Aw, heh.

10
00:00:37,360 --> 00:00:38,440
(Penny:)Mm.

11
00:00:40,363 --> 00:00:44,073
(Penny:)Hey, you know
how we've been taking things slow?

12
00:00:44,284 --> 00:00:45,324
(Leonard:)Mm-hm.

13
00:00:45,535 --> 00:00:46,825
Well, l've been thinking...

14
00:00:47,037 --> 00:00:51,917
(Penny:)...and maybe I'm ready
to take things a little faster.

15
00:00:52,125 --> 00:00:54,375
- Oh, great.
- Mm-hm.

16
00:00:54,586 --> 00:01:01,026
(Leonard:)And I promise, after waiting four months,
fast is what you're gonna get.

